></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">FTE Leader:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">No</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Direct Supervision:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Reports to:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Director of Nursing</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Position Summary:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The GNA/Cert Med Aide works under the direction of the Restorative Nurse and will provide assistance in the delivery of rehabilitative care, monitor the quality of care provided, and provide direct routine patient care as needed. They will also drive the van as needed to transport residents to and from Doctor’s appointments. The inventory, distribution/delivery of medications may be required.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Education:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"\">Certified as a Geriatric Nursing Assistant and Medicine Aide in the State of Maryland.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Experience:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in; line-height:115%\"><a name=\"_Hlk215476528\"></a><span style=\"\"></span>Basic computer skills preferred. </li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in; line-height:115%\">Experience as a GNA and Certified Medicine Aide is preferred.</li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"\">Schedule:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Monday – Friday, possible Day, Evening or Night shifts.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Weekends required per unit need.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Holidays per departmental policy.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"\">Please let me know if you have any questions.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">People Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">tidalhealth.org</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}